  "description": "Migration step 8 of the device > carrier > plan model (rule round 47, item 4): dated tariffs, options and packs as the carrier's own pages name them, with feature states. A state other than depends_on_plan, ended, not_offered or unknown rests on a passage of that page. brand_features says what a brand states for a feature with no named offer; depends_on_plan means the plan decides. No phone can see an offer: this is a dated claim, never proof that a line has a feature. Nothing here changes a for_you answer, a value or a match, no phone sends a plan, and phones never read this file.",
  "display_rule": "Show a state as what the carrier states, read on checked_at. Say that the person's plan is not checked. Never show a state as works, booked or you have it.",
